WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.500
See every student's thinking. On one screen.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.350
I start a live room from my lesson board.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:14.350
My class joins with a code.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.400
Every student gets their own square.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.783
I see everyone's work, live.

00:00:19.883 --> 00:00:22.383
A hand goes up. No calling out.

00:00:22.483 --> 00:00:25.700
We go one step at a time.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.016
Their work stays private. I see it all.

00:00:30.117 --> 00:00:35.167
Bring everyone to me to show an idea.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.184
Then back to their own square.

00:00:37.283 --> 00:00:44.833
Quick feedback, right in their square.

00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:52.483
They check their own answers.

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:58.133
Recess? End the room.

00:00:58.233 --> 00:01:01.933
After recess, every square and step is right where they left it.

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:06.183
See every student's thinking. On one screen. Math manipulatives for K-8. oomba.ai

